   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Urban Landscape Forest</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Urban Landscape Forest Elements: Restoration and Preference\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Wu et al. (2021), Land 10:1349: view 18 images of an urban ginkgo landscape forest with added terrain, water, flowers and shrubs (plus two city scenes) for 15 seconds each, then rate the six-item Restoration Outcome Scale (1–7) and preference (0–4).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"forest\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part and know I can stop at any time.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"images\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"forest_ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Imagine you are in this scene. How likely are these statements to describe how you would feel there?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"One trial per image (key picture_01 … picture_18, numbered as in the paper's Figure 1: 01 urban transportation, 02 city square (group A); 03 ginkgo landscape forest (B); 04–07 forest with one added element (C: terrain, water, flowers, shrubs); 08–13 two elements (D); 14–17 three elements (E); 18 all four (F)). Each image is shown alone for 15 s, then rated. Value: { ros1 … ros6 } each 1 = very unlikely … 7 = very likely (Restoration Outcome Scale; restoration value = mean of the six), and preference 0 = do not like it at all … 4 = like it very much. Element dummies for regression: terrain/water/flowers/shrubs present per the labels.\",\n      \"items\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros1\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel restored and relaxed.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros2\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel calm.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros3\",\n        \"text\": \"I have energy for my everyday routines.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros4\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel focused and alert.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros5\",\n        \"text\": \"I can forget everyday worries.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ros6\",\n        \"text\": \"My thoughts are clear.\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 7,\n        \"low\": \"Very unlikely\",\n        \"high\": \"Very likely\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"preference\",\n        \"text\": \"How much do you like this scene or environment?\",\n        \"min\": 0,\n        \"max\": 4,\n        \"low\": \"I do not like it at all\",\n        \"high\": \"I like it very much\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_01\",\n        \"label\": \"Urban transportation\",\n        \"group\": \"A\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_02\",\n        \"label\": \"City square\",\n        \"group\": \"A\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_03\",\n        \"label\": \"Urban landscape forest\",\n        \"group\": \"B\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_04\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain\",\n        \"group\": \"C\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_05\",\n        \"label\": \"With water\",\n        \"group\": \"C\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_06\",\n        \"label\": \"With flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"C\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_07\",\n        \"label\": \"With shrubs\",\n        \"group\": \"C\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_08\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, water\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_09\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_10\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, shrubs\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_11\",\n        \"label\": \"With water, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_12\",\n        \"label\": \"With flowers, shrubs\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_13\",\n        \"label\": \"With water, shrubs\",\n        \"group\": \"D\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_14\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, water, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"E\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_15\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, water, shrubs\",\n        \"group\": \"E\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_16\",\n        \"label\": \"With water, shrubs, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"E\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_17\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, shrubs, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"E\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"picture_18\",\n        \"label\": \"With terrain, water, shrubs, flowers\",\n        \"group\": \"F\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3f2ea;--card:#fff;--ink:#16231f;--muted:#53645e;--accent:#7a6a1c;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d2ddd9;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:200px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n.pic{background:#dfe6e3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.pic img{width:100%;max-height:min(50vh,460px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px}.seg.s5{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}\n.seg label{display:block;cursor:pointer}\n.seg input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}\n.seg span{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.seg input:checked+span{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.seg input:focus-visible+span{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.anch{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.view{position:relative}.cd{position:absolute;right:10px;top:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.pic.sm img{max-height:min(30vh,280px)}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Images: Wu, Dong, Luo, Jiang, Hao &amp; Chen (2021), Land 10:1349, doi:10.3390/land10121349, Figure 1 (CC BY 4.0). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='ulforest2021:', IDS=[];for(var i=1;i<=18;i++)IDS.push('picture_'+(i<10?'0':'')+i);var N=IDS.length,timer=null;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, done={}, order=[], SPEC=null, ITEMS=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function rng(it){var a=[];for(var v=(it.min==null?1:it.min);v<=(it.max==null?7:it.max);v++)a.push(v);return a;}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    clearInterval(timer);app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;\n  }\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[order[i]])return image(i);}\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    if(IDS.some(function(k){return !files[k+'.jpg'];})){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder forest must hold picture_01.jpg … picture_18.jpg.</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Urban landscape forests</h1><p>You will see 18 pictures, one at a time: two city scenes and an urban ginkgo forest shown with different added elements such as terrain, water, flowers and shrubs. Each picture is shown on its own for 15 seconds: look at it carefully. Then you answer seven short questions about it. It takes about 10 minutes. Your answers are anonymous and you can stop at any time.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function image(i){\n    var k=order[i], f=files[k+'.jpg'], n=0, left=15;order.forEach(function(x){if(done[x])n++;});\n    var top='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Picture '+(n+1)+' of '+N+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/N)+'%\"></i></div></div>';\n    clearInterval(timer);\n    app.innerHTML=top+'<div class=\"card view\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Landscape picture\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><span class=\"cd\" id=\"cd\">15</span></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px\">Look at the picture. The questions appear after 15 seconds.</p>';\n    timer=setInterval(function(){left--;var c=document.getElementById('cd');if(c)c.textContent=left;if(left<=0){clearInterval(timer);rate();}},1000);\n    function rate(){\n      window.scrollTo(0,0);\n      var rows=ITEMS.map(function(it){return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(it.text)+'</b><div class=\"seg'+(rng(it).length===5?' s5':'')+'\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(it.text)+'\">'+rng(it).map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+it.id+'\" value=\"'+v+'\"><span>'+v+'</span></label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"anch\"><span>'+esc(it.low)+'</span><span>'+esc(it.high)+'</span></div></div>';}).join('');\n      page(top+'<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic sm\"><img alt=\"Landscape picture\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">'+esc(q('forest_ratings').title)+'</p>'+rows+'</div>',n===N-1?'Finish':'Next picture',function(){\n        var v={};for(var j=0;j<ITEMS.length;j++){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+ITEMS[j].id+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer every question.');v[ITEMS[j].id]=Number(x.value);}\n        var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n        SPSite.answer('forest_ratings',v,{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}done[k]=true;next();});\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  function about(){\n    var ns=['gender','age'];\n    var h=ns.map(function(n){var d=q(n);if(d.type!=='radiogroup')return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b><input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" name=\"'+n+'\"></div>';\n      return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('');\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\">'+h+'</div>','Continue',function(){\n      var l=[];for(var i=0;i<ns.length;i++){var n=ns[i];if(n==='age'){var a=Number(app.querySelector('input[name=age]').value.trim());if(!a||a<16||a>110)return err('Please enter your age in years.');l.push(['age',a]);continue;}\n        var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+q(n).title);l.push([n,Number(x.value)]);}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll(l,b,function(){ans.about=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The forest pictures were all made from one photograph of an urban ginkgo forest, with terrain, water, flowers and shrubs added in different combinations. In the original study with 120 university students in Chengdu, the two city scenes (traffic and a city square) were rated least restorative, and the forest with water and terrain, and with water, terrain and shrubs, most restorative. The forest with water alone was liked most. Water was the only added element that clearly raised both restoration and preference; terrain, flowers and shrubs made no significant difference.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Images and questions: Wu, L., Dong, Q., Luo, S., Jiang, W., Hao, M., &amp; Chen, Q. (2021). Effects of spatial elements of urban landscape forests on the restoration potential and preference of adolescents. Land 10:1349, doi:10.3390/land10121349.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='forest_ratings')done={};else ans.about=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={type:e.type,title:g.title||e.title,isRequired:e.isRequired,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='forest_ratings')ITEMS=e.items;});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('forest')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var o=load('order');if(!o||o.length!==N)o=shuffle(IDS);order=o;save('order',order);\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.forest_ratings&&a.forest_ratings.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.about=a.age!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
